--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Fuigo is a modified derivative work of Grok Build, xAI's command-line
coding agent.

    Upstream:       https://github.com/xai-org/grok-build
    Upstream HEAD:  bb7f39d5858cbf5e00de639367f59debbdcb0138
    Synced from:    d761e8ba538084df023de79d26892eaf73ed7411
    Upstream date:  2026-08-31
    Forked:         2026-09-01
    Fork version:   Fuigo 1.0.1 (upstream was 1.0.13)

Every file in this distribution that derives from Grok Build has been
modified. The modifications are extensive and mechanical rather than
localised, so rather than annotate ~2,960 individual files, this notice
states the change set as a whole:

  1. RENAMING. All product, company, crate, module, type, environment
     variable and filesystem identifiers bearing the "Grok", "xAI" or
     "SpaceXAI" marks were renamed to "Fuigo" / "Ferrox Labs". The
     transform that performed this is published in this repository's
     history under tools/rebrand/ and is reproducible from the upstream
     revision named above.

  2. INFERENCE BACKEND. The default inference, model-catalogue and
     authentication endpoints were repointed from xAI's services
     (api.x.ai, cli-chat-proxy.grok.com, auth.x.ai) to FluxRouter
     (api.fluxrouter.ai). The shipped default model list was replaced.

  3. REMOVED SERVICES. First-party telemetry, announcements, promotional
     campaigns, subscription gating, update distribution and changelog
     fetching were removed or made inert, as they address xAI services
     that Fuigo has no relationship with.

  4. DEFECT FIXES. Four build defects present in the upstream public
     snapshot were repaired so the test suite compiles.

